  "copyright_rule": "Do not bypass paywalls, DRM, access controls or license restrictions. Archive full standards/books/closed papers only when supplied by the user or when the project has lawful access and copying is permitted.",
  "memory_rule": "Memory indexes the evidence and extracted knowledge; the Data Center stores permitted binary/full-text copies."
